cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MR Gym, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "MR Gym: a virtual MRI scanner you can drop an AI agent into"
abstract: >-
  MR Gym is a virtual MRI scanner that an AI agent operates through tool calls: it plans and runs priced scans of a
  hidden simulated object and is scored on what it delivers. An environment counts as admitted only when a reference
  policy passes it and every shortcut policy fails. Research preview; expert review remains pending.
authors:
